                          | XDMA_CTRL_IE_ALIGNMENT_MISMATCH | XDMA_CTRL_IE_MAGIC_STOPPED \
                          | XDMA_CTRL_IE_INVALID_LENGTH | XDMA_CTRL_IE_READ_ERROR | XDMA_CTRL_IE_WRITE_ERROR\
                          | XDMA_CTRL_IE_DESCRIPTOR_ERROR)

